# phi-agent — assistant perimeter (general, academic, inline).
#
# Grammar: see the header of ~/.local/bin/phi-agent-contain.
# Shared by every profile that keeps the host network namespace. Everything
# that depends on the profile, project, session or folder flags — memory,
# the project, folders of interest, sessions — is script code in
# phi-agent-contain, because the .paths grammar has no conditionals; this
# file holds only the one bind that is the same for every invocation.

# Per-profile cache — writable. pi and its tools keep scratch state here;
# nothing in it is session content the agent authored.
rw   @AGENT_CACHE@               @CONTAINER_HOME@/.cache
